# deep-merge: merge two non-overlapping 500-entry dicts into a 1000-entry result
# d1 has integer keys 0..499, d2 has integer keys 500..999 (no overlap)
[let d1 [collect [range 0 500]]]
[let d2 [build-dict [builtin-map [fn [v] [key: v  value: v]] [each [collect [range 500 1000]]]]]]
[length [deep-merge d1 d2]]
=== out
Int(2)
